<title>UK: TABLE - Lonrho first-half profit falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Lonrho first-half profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		2.3		    vs 4.1</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.25		   vs same</p>
<p> Pretax		     38		     vs 61</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,011		  vs 1,035</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 38 and 40 million stg. The results exclude a net profit on disposal of Lonrho Sugar of 129 million stg, Lonrho Plc said.</p>
<p>Full company name - Lonrho Plc, a comglomerate with mining, trading and hotels interests.</p>
</text>
